IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-DEJAVU-ATTN.

DATA DIVISION.
01 NUM-HEADS           PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 RATIO-PCT           PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 ACTIVE-HEADS        PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 SPARSITY-PCT        PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-DEJAVU-ATTN.
    IF NUM-HEADS == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    IF RATIO-PCT == 0
        MOVE 50 TO RATIO-PCT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE NUM-HEADS TO ACTIVE-HEADS.
    MULTIPLY RATIO-PCT BY ACTIVE-HEADS.
    DIVIDE 100 INTO ACTIVE-HEADS.
    MOVE NUM-HEADS TO SPARSITY-PCT.
    SUBTRACT ACTIVE-HEADS FROM SPARSITY-PCT.
    MOVE SPARSITY-PCT TO ACTIVE-HEADS.
    MOVE RATIO-PCT TO SPARSITY-PCT.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 ACTIVE-HEADS.
    WEIGHT 30 SPARSITY-PCT.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
